  <section data-v-07822acf="" class="my-4">
    <h2 data-v-07822acf="">Participation notifications</h2>
    <div data-v-07822acf="" class="field"><strong data-v-07822acf="">Mobilizon will send you an email when the events you are attending have important changes: date and time, address, confirmation or cancellation, etc.</strong></div>
    <p data-v-07822acf="">Other notification options:</p>
